<title>USA: Serv-Tech ends Hydrochem talks.</title>
<headline>Serv-Tech ends Hydrochem talks.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Serv-Tech Inc said on Monday it terminated merger negoations with HydroChem Industrial Services because the companies were unable to reach final agreeable terms and conditions.</p>
<p>Serv-Tech said in a statement it had therefore hired investment banking firm Simmons &amp; Co International to assist in exploring strategic alternatives to enhance shareholder value.</p>
<p>The company provides specialty maintenance, electrical and instrumentation, and environmental services and products.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
